        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fd1cd92ed99640cf93ad2e70fe632157",
      "statement": "acks defaults to all, meaning the leader waits for the full in-sync replica set; acks=0 gives no delivery guarantee and returns offset -1, and acks=1 can lose data if the leader fails before replication.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/generated/producer_config.html#L653-L662",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bc65e13c3cc8fffb82809b12ac29371006ae20e9279df086a0b69774fe2d6804:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0d4454401e8d40c389559c9100b9b915",
      "statement": "Idempotence is enabled by default and requires max.in.flight.requests.per.connection <= 5, retries > 0 and acks=all; conflicting configs silently disable it unless it was explicitly enabled, in which case a ConfigException is thrown.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/generated/producer_config.html#L683-L692",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5162c4b7227700a9fff641c9299b5a703d21643e201b91959d48b872791b40de:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f29beb28dba64b0f9c8eaa57be7d8331",
      "statement": "With no partitioner.class set, keyed records are hashed to a partition and unkeyed records use a sticky partition that changes after batch.size bytes, optionally rack-aware via client.rack and partitioner.rack.aware.",
      "evidence": [
